{"id": "em-001", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：点电荷场强叠加", "question": "真空中相距 d 的两个点电荷，电量分别为 +q 与 −q。求连线中点处的电场强度大小（用 k、q、d 表示，k 为库仑常数）。", "expected_answer": ["8kq/d²", "8kq/d^2", "\\frac{8kq}{d^2}", "\\dfrac{8kq}{d^2}"], "answer_check": {"type": "symbolic"}, "solution_path": "中点处两电荷产生的场同向（都指向 −q 一侧），叠加相加：E = kq/(d/2)² + kq/(d/2)² = 2·4kq/d² = 8kq/d²。", "key_steps": [{"point": "判断两场在中点同向，相加不抵消", "evidence": ["同向", "相加", "叠加", "不抵消", "不能抵消"]}, {"point": "单个电荷在中点 E=kq/(d/2)²", "evidence": ["(d/2)^2", "(d/2)²", "d^2/4", "d²/4", "4"]}, {"point": "求和得 8kq/d²", "evidence": ["8kq", "8"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "0", "desc": "误认为两场在中点反向抵消"}, {"wrong": "2kq/d^2", "desc": "漏了 (d/2)² 展开的因子 4"}], "notes": "answer_check 用 symbolic：accept 匹配串即 expected_answer 列表。", "verify": {"mode": "assert", "expr": "simplify(2*k*q/(d/2)**2 - 8*k*q/d**2) == 0"}}
{"id": "em-002", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：电容器与静电平衡", "question": "平行板电容器电容 C=εS/d。在两极板之间平行插入一块厚度为 d/2 的导体板（与极板不接触），求新的电容。", "expected_answer": ["2C", "2εS/d", "2\\epsilon S/d"], "answer_check": {"type": "symbolic"}, "solution_path": "静电平衡下导体内部场强为零，导体板整体相当于一段『零场区』，等效极板间距变为 d/2；C′ = εS/(d/2) = 2εS/d = 2C，电容加倍。", "key_steps": [{"point": "导体内部场为零（静电平衡）", "evidence": ["静电平衡", "为零", "为0", "零场"]}, {"point": "等效间距 d/2", "evidence": ["d/2"]}, {"point": "C′=2C（加倍）", "evidence": ["2c", "2ε", "2\\epsilon", "加倍"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "c/2", "desc": "误以为插入导体使电容减半"}, {"wrong": "=c", "desc": "认为插入导体板不影响电容"}], "notes": "", "verify": {"mode": "assert", "expr": "simplify(epsilon*Area/(d - d/2) - 2*epsilon*Area/d) == 0"}}
{"id": "em-003", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：并联电阻", "question": "请判断这个说法是否正确：「两个电阻并联后，总电阻比其中任何一个都大，因为电流要走的『总路程』变长了。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。并联时总电阻的倒数等于各电阻倒数之和（1/R = 1/R₁ + 1/R₂，即电导相加），总电阻小于任何一个支路电阻。『路程变长』是串联的图像，不是并联。", "key_steps": [{"point": "明确判断：并联总电阻小于任一支路电阻", "evidence": ["小于", "更小", "比任何一个都小", "不对", "错误"]}, {"point": "给出正确关系（倒数和/电导相加）", "evidence": ["1/r", "倒数", "电导"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "更大", "desc": "串联直觉误用到并联"}], "notes": ""}
{"id": "em-004", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：感生电场（法拉第定律）", "question": "无限长圆柱区域内磁场均匀分布且随时间均匀增强，磁感应强度变化率 dB/dt = k（正常数）。在场区内距轴线 r 处，感生电场的场强大小是多少？", "expected_answer": ["kr/2", "\\frac{kr}{2}", "\\dfrac{kr}{2}", "0.5kr"], "answer_check": {"type": "symbolic"}, "solution_path": "取半径 r 的圆形环路，感生电场沿切向：∮E·dl = E·2πr = |dΦ/dt| = πr²·k，得 E = kr/2。", "key_steps": [{"point": "对圆形环路用法拉第定律（感生电场环量≠0）", "evidence": ["∮", "环路", "法拉第", "感应"]}, {"point": "E·2πr = πr²k", "evidence": ["2πr", "2\\pir"]}, {"point": "E=kr/2", "evidence": ["kr/2", "\\frac{kr}{2}", "0.5kr", "½kr"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "e=kr", "desc": "把 2πr 写成 πr，丢了 1/2 因子"}, {"wrong": "kr^2/2", "desc": "场强表达式里混入 r²（量纲错）"}], "notes": "", "verify": {"mode": "assert", "expr": "simplify(pi*r**2*k/(2*pi*r) - k*r/2) == 0"}}
{"id": "em-005", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：库仑定律", "question": "真空中两点电荷 q₁=3 μC、q₂=−2 μC 相距 0.1 m。求它们之间库仑力的大小（N）。", "expected_answer": ["5.4 N"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 5.4, "tol": 0.02}, "solution_path": "F=kq₁q₂/r²=9×10⁹·3×10⁻⁶·2×10⁻⁶/0.01=54/10=5.4 N（异号相吸）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "库仑定律 F=kq₁q₂/r²", "evidence": ["f=kq₁q₂/r²", "f=kq1q2/r^2", "库仑定律", "f=kq1q2/r²"]}, {"point": "代入 9×10⁹ 与 6×10⁻¹²", "evidence": ["代入", "10^-12", "54", "9e9"]}, {"point": "F=5.4 N（吸引）", "evidence": ["5.4", "吸引"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "0.54", "desc": "分母忘平方（用了 r=0.1 而非 0.01）"}, {"wrong": "力是6", "desc": "只把电荷乘积 6 当力，漏了 k 与 r²"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(9e9*3e-6*2e-6/0.01)"}}
{"id": "em-006", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：串联电路", "question": "电阻 3 Ω 与 7 Ω 串联接在 20 V 电源上（忽略内阻）。求总电阻与电流。", "expected_answer": ["R=10 Ω；I=2 A"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [10, 2], "tol": 0.02}, "solution_path": "串联相加 R=3+7=10 Ω；I=U/R=20/10=2 A。", "key_steps": [{"point": "串联 R=R₁+R₂=10", "evidence": ["r=r₁+r₂", "r=r1+r2", "串联相加", "3+7"]}, {"point": "欧姆定律 I=U/R", "evidence": ["i=u/r", "i=U/R", "欧姆定律", "20/10"]}, {"point": "R=10 Ω、I=2 A", "evidence": ["i=2", "10ω", "2a", "=2"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "电流与电阻对调", "desc": "把总电阻当电流、电流当电阻（没写单位自查）"}, {"wrong": "电流6.7", "desc": "漏加一个电阻（20/3≈6.7）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[float(3+7), float(20/10)]"}}
{"id": "em-007", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：并联电阻", "question": "求 4 Ω 与 12 Ω 两电阻并联后的等效电阻。", "expected_answer": ["3 Ω"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 3, "tol": 0.02}, "solution_path": "并联：1/R=1/4+1/12=4/12=1/3，R=3 Ω（小于任一支路）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "并联倒数相加 1/R=1/4+1/12", "evidence": ["1/r=1/4+1/12", "1/r=1/4", "倒数相加", "电导"]}, {"point": "1/R=1/3", "evidence": ["1/3", "1/r=1/3"]}, {"point": "R=3 Ω", "evidence": ["r=3", "=3", "3ω"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "电阻8", "desc": "按串联相加（4+12）/2 或直接相加思路"}, {"wrong": "电阻16", "desc": "用乘积除以错的量（4·12/3）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(1/(Rational(1,4)+Rational(1,12)))"}}
{"id": "em-008", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：电场力做功 W=qU", "question": "电荷 q=2 μC 从 A 移到 B，A、B 间电压 U_AB=50 V。求电场力做的功（J）。", "expected_answer": ["1×10⁻⁴ J"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 0.0001, "tol": 1e-05}, "solution_path": "W=qU=2×10⁻⁶·50=1×10⁻⁴ J。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 W=qU", "evidence": ["w=qu", "qu", "做功"]}, {"point": "代入 2×10⁻⁶·50", "evidence": ["代入", "2μc", "50v"]}, {"point": "W=1×10⁻⁴ J", "evidence": ["10^-4", "1e-4", "0.0001"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "100", "desc": "忘了微库换算成库仑（2·50 直接当焦耳）"}, {"wrong": "0.01", "desc": "单位换算多除一步（μC 当 10⁻⁴）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(2e-6*50)"}}
{"id": "em-009", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：高斯定律（球对称）", "question": "半径 0.1 m 的导体球均匀带电 q=1 μC（k=9×10⁹）。求球面外紧贴表面处的电场强度大小（以 kN/C 为单位给数值）。", "expected_answer": ["900 kN/C（=9×10⁵ N/C）"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 900, "tol": 2}, "solution_path": "球对称：等效于点电荷在球心，E=kq/r²=9×10⁹·1×10⁻⁶/0.01=9×10⁵ N/C，即 900 kN/C（径向向外）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "球对称用高斯定律等效点电荷", "evidence": ["高斯", "球对称", "等效点电荷", "球面"]}, {"point": "E=kq/r²", "evidence": ["e=kq/r²", "e=kq/r^2", "kq/r²"]}, {"point": "E=900 kN/C", "evidence": ["900"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "9e4", "desc": "r 没平方（分母用 0.1）"}, {"wrong": "9e6", "desc": "μC 换算错（按 10⁻⁵ C 算）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(9e9*1e-6/0.01/1000)"}}
{"id": "em-010", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：电容器储能", "question": "电容 C=10 μF 的电容器充电到 100 V。求储存的能量（J）。", "expected_answer": ["0.05 J"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 0.05, "tol": 0.001}, "solution_path": "E=½CU²=0.5·10×10⁻⁶·100²=0.05 J。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 E=½CU²", "evidence": ["e=½cu²", "e=½cu^2", "½cu²", "\\frac{1}{2}cu^2"]}, {"point": "U²=10⁴", "evidence": ["10⁴", "10^4", "10000", "u²", "u^2"]}, {"point": "E=0.05 J", "evidence": ["0.05"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "能量1", "desc": "忘乘 ½（CU² 直接当能量）"}, {"wrong": "0.0005", "desc": "电压没平方（½·C·U）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Rational(1,2)*1e-5*1e4)"}}
{"id": "em-011", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：安培力 F=BIL", "question": "直导线长 0.4 m，通电流 3 A，置于 B=0.5 T 的匀强磁场中，导线与磁场垂直。求导线所受安培力大小。", "expected_answer": ["0.6 N"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 0.6, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "F=BIL=0.5·3·0.4=0.6 N（方向由左手定则确定）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 F=BIL", "evidence": ["f=bil", "安培力", "bil"]}, {"point": "垂直放置 sin90°=1", "evidence": ["垂直", "sin90", "90°"]}, {"point": "F=0.6 N", "evidence": ["0.6"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "力是0.2", "desc": "漏乘电流（只算 B·L）"}, {"wrong": "忘了夹角", "desc": "题目已垂直，仍乱乘 sinθ 以外的因子"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Rational(1,2)*3*Rational(2,5))"}}
{"id": "em-012", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：带电粒子在磁场中的圆周半径", "question": "电子（q=1.6×10⁻¹⁹ C，m=9.1×10⁻³¹ kg）以 v=2×10⁶ m/s 垂直射入 B=0.01 T 的匀强磁场。求圆周运动半径（米，保留四位有效数字）。", "expected_answer": ["≈ 1.138×10⁻³ m"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 0.0011375, "tol": 1e-05, "alt_values": [{"value": 1.138, "tol": 0.002}]}, "solution_path": "r=mv/(qB)=9.1×10⁻³¹·2×10⁶/(1.6×10⁻¹⁹·0.01)=1.82×10⁻²⁴/1.6×10⁻²¹≈1.138×10⁻³ m（约 1.14 mm）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "洛伦兹力当向心力 qvB=mv²/r", "evidence": ["qvB=mv²/r", "qvB=mv^2/r", "向心力", "洛伦兹"]}, {"point": "r=mv/(qB)", "evidence": ["r=mv/(qb)", "mv/(qb)", "r=mv/qB"]}, {"point": "≈1.138×10⁻³ m", "evidence": ["1.138", "1.14", "1.14mm"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "1.82e-26", "desc": "忘了除以 qB（把 mv 当半径）"}, {"wrong": "忘了除以电荷", "desc": "分母漏乘 q，只除以 B"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(9.1e-31*2e6/(1.6e-19*0.01))"}}
{"id": "em-013", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：LC 振荡频率", "question": "LC 振荡电路中 L=2 mH、C=5 pF。求振荡频率 f（Hz，保留三位有效数字）。", "expected_answer": ["≈ 1.59×10⁶ Hz"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 1591549, "tol": 5000, "alt_values": [{"value": 1.59, "tol": 0.01}]}, "solution_path": "f=1/(2π√(LC))=1/(2π√(2×10⁻³·5×10⁻¹²))=1/(2π·10⁻⁷)≈1.59×10⁶ Hz。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 f=1/(2π√(LC))", "evidence": ["f=1/(2π√(lc))", "1/(2π√(lc))", "1/(2π", "固有频率"]}, {"point": "LC=10⁻¹⁴，√(LC)=10⁻⁷", "evidence": ["10⁻¹⁴", "10⁻⁷", "10^-14", "10^-7"]}, {"point": "f≈1.59×10⁶ Hz", "evidence": ["1.59", "10⁶", "10^6", "159万", "1.59mhz"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "忘了开平方", "desc": "把 LC 当 √(LC) 直接代入"}, {"wrong": "数量级多一个10", "desc": "换算时多乘了一个 10"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(1/(2*pi*sqrt(2e-3*5e-12)))"}}
{"id": "em-014", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：电场线不能相交", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「两条电场线可以相交，交点处场强是两个场强的叠加。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。电场线上每一点的切线方向就是该点场强方向；若两条线相交，交点处场强就有两个方向，与场强唯一性矛盾。所以电场线不相交（也不相切）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出切线方向＝场强方向", "evidence": ["切线", "场强方向", "切线方向"]}, {"point": "相交则场强有两个方向，矛盾", "evidence": ["两个方向", "矛盾", "唯一", "唯一确定"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "可以相交", "desc": "把矢量叠加的合法性与场线几何性质混淆"}]}
{"id": "em-015", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：洛伦兹力不做功", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「磁场中的运动电荷受洛伦兹力，洛伦兹力对它做正功，使它越飞越快。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。洛伦兹力 F=qv×B 恒垂直于速度 v，只改变速度方向不改变速率；F·v=0，洛伦兹力永远不做功。粒子在匀强磁场中做匀速圆周运动，速率不变。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出 F⊥v、不做功", "evidence": ["垂直", "不做功", "fv=0"]}, {"point": "只改变方向不改变速率", "evidence": ["改变方向", "速率不变", "不改变速率", "匀速圆周"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "做正功", "desc": "把「有力的作用」误当「力一定做功」"}]}
{"id": "em-016", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "concept", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "探针：电场线不是轨迹", "question": "有同学说：「电场线就是带电粒子的运动轨迹，粒子沿线跑。」这个说法对吗？请说明电场线的本质含义，并举一个反例。", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。电场线是人为画出的曲线，切线方向表示场强方向；带电粒子的轨迹由初速度与合力共同决定。反例：匀强电场中斜射入的电子做抛物线运动（初速度不沿场线时轨迹是曲线），静电平衡导体内部场线不存在但电荷仍可运动。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出场线表示场强方向（切线）", "evidence": ["切线", "场强方向", "表示"]}, {"point": "轨迹由初速度与受力共同决定", "evidence": ["初速度", "共同决定", "合力"]}, {"point": "举斜入射电子抛物线反例", "evidence": ["抛物线", "斜射", "类平抛", "曲线"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "就是轨迹", "desc": "把「方向示意」当成「路径」"}]}
{"id": "em-017", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：电势叠加（标量）", "question": "两点电荷 q₁=2 μC 与 q₂=2 μC 分别位于原点和 x=0.3 m 处（k=9×10⁹）。求它们连线中点的电势（用 kV 作答）。", "expected_answer": ["240 kV"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 240, "tol": 2}, "solution_path": "电势是标量直接相加：φ=2·kq/(0.15)=2·9×10⁹·2×10⁻⁶/0.15=2.4×10⁵ V=240 kV。", "key_steps": [{"point": "电势按标量叠加（无方向抵消）", "evidence": ["标量", "相加", "叠加"]}, {"point": "单电荷电势 kq/0.15", "evidence": ["kq/0.15", "单个电荷电势"]}, {"point": "总和 240 kV", "evidence": ["240", "240kv", "2.4e5"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "120", "desc": "只算了一个电荷的电势"}, {"wrong": "480", "desc": "距离用了 0.3 m（没取到中点的 0.15）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(2*9e9*2e-6/0.15/1000)"}}
{"id": "em-018", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：电功率与欧姆定律", "question": "电热水壶接 220 V 电源，加热丝电阻 44 Ω。求工作电流与发热功率。", "expected_answer": ["I=5 A；P=1100 W"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [5, 1100], "tol": 2}, "solution_path": "I=U/R=220/44=5 A；P=UI=220·5=1100 W（或 U²/R）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "欧姆定律 I=U/R=5", "evidence": ["i=u/r", "220/44", "5a", "=5"]}, {"point": "功率 P=UI 或 U²/R", "evidence": ["p=ui", "p=u²/r", "p=u^2/r", "功率"]}, {"point": "P=1100 W", "evidence": ["1100", "1.1kw", "1.1kw"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "功率电流对调", "desc": "把 5 A 与 1100 W 的位置对调（单位不查）"}, {"wrong": "功率220", "desc": "把电压数值当功率"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[float(220/44), float(220**2/44)]"}}
{"id": "em-019", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：场强零点（平方反比配平）", "question": "点电荷 +4q 与 +q 相距 0.5 m（+4q 在左）。求连线上场强为零的点到 +4q 的距离。", "expected_answer": ["1/3 m ≈ 0.333 m"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 0.3333, "tol": 0.005}, "solution_path": "两场在两点荷之间反向，零点居中偏 +q 一侧：4/x²=1/(0.5−x)² → 2/x=1/(0.5−x) → x=1/3≈0.333 m。", "key_steps": [{"point": "零点在两电荷之间（同号）", "evidence": ["之间", "同号", "中间"]}, {"point": "列 4/x²=1/(0.5−x)²", "evidence": ["4/x^2", "4/x²", "平方反比", "配平"]}, {"point": "x=1/3≈0.333 m", "evidence": ["1/3", "0.33", "0.333"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "0.25", "desc": "按电荷线性比例分（4:1 分段）"}, {"wrong": "0.167", "desc": "比例方向反了（靠 +4q 侧）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Rational(1,2)*2/(1+2))"}}
{"id": "em-020", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：串联电容", "question": "电容 C₁=6 μF 与 C₂=3 μF 串联。求等效电容。", "expected_answer": ["2 μF"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 2, "tol": 0.05}, "solution_path": "串联：1/C=1/6+1/3=1/2，C=2 μF（小于任何一个）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "串联倒数相加 1/C=1/6+1/3", "evidence": ["1/c=1/6+1/3", "1/c=1/6", "倒数相加"]}, {"point": "1/C=1/2", "evidence": ["1/2", "1/c=1/2"]}, {"point": "C=2 μF", "evidence": ["c=2", "=2", "2μf"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "9", "desc": "按并联公式直接相加"}, {"wrong": "18", "desc": "乘积 6·3 当等效电容（没除 9）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(1/(Rational(1,6)+Rational(1,3)))"}}
{"id": "em-021", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：法拉第定律（磁通变化率）", "question": "单匝线圈内磁通量在 0.2 s 内从 0.4 Wb 均匀减小到零。求感应电动势的大小，并说明感应电流的磁场方向。", "expected_answer": ["2 V；感应电流磁场阻碍磁通减小"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 2, "tol": 0.05}, "solution_path": "|ε|=|ΔΦ/Δt|=0.4/0.2=2 V；原磁通减小，由楞次定律感应电流的磁场与原磁场同向（阻碍减小）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "法拉第定律 ε=ΔΦ/Δt", "evidence": ["e=δφ/δt", "ε=ΔΦ/Δt", "法拉第", "磁通变化率"]}, {"point": "0.4/0.2=2 V", "evidence": ["0.4/0.2", "2v", "=2"]}, {"point": "楞次定律定方向（阻碍减小）", "evidence": ["楞次", "阻碍", "同向"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "0.1", "desc": "把 ΔΦ 与 Δt 相乘"}, {"wrong": "感应0", "desc": "以为磁通减到零就没有感应（变化率才是关键）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Rational(2,5)/Rational(1,5))"}}
{"id": "em-022", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：理想变压器", "question": "理想变压器原线圈 200 匝接 220 V 交流电，副线圈 50 匝。求副线圈电压。", "expected_answer": ["55 V"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 55, "tol": 0.5}, "solution_path": "匝比：U₂=U₁·N₂/N₁=220·50/200=55 V。", "key_steps": [{"point": "变压比 U₁/U₂=N₁/N₂", "evidence": ["u₁/u₂=n₁/n₂", "u1/u2=n1/n2", "变压比", "匝数比"]}, {"point": "220·50/200", "evidence": ["代入", "50/200", "匝比"]}, {"point": "U₂=55 V", "evidence": ["55v", "=55", "55"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "880", "desc": "匝比放反（220·200/50）"}, {"wrong": "110", "desc": "当成匝数减半处理（220/2）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(220*Rational(1,4))"}}
{"id": "em-023", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：RC 时间常数", "question": "RC 电路中 R=20 kΩ、C=100 μF，串联回路经开关由电源充电。求时间常数 τ（秒），并指出电压升至初值 63.2% 所需时间。", "expected_answer": ["τ=2 s；63.2% 需 2 s"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 2, "tol": 0.05}, "solution_path": "τ=RC=20×10³·100×10⁻⁶=2 s；一个时间常数充到 1−e⁻¹≈63.2%，即 2 s。", "key_steps": [{"point": "τ=RC", "evidence": ["τ=rc", "τ=RC", "时间常数"]}, {"point": "20×10³·100×10⁻⁶=2", "evidence": ["代入", "单位换算", "10⁻⁶", "=2"]}, {"point": "一个 τ 达 63.2%", "evidence": ["63.2", "0.632", "1−e⁻¹"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "2000", "desc": "忘了 μF→F 或 kΩ→Ω 的换算"}, {"wrong": "0.002", "desc": "单位多换算了一层"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(20e3*100e-6)"}}
{"id": "em-024", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：无限长直导线的磁场", "question": "无限长直导线通电流 10 A，距导线 0.04 m 处的磁感应强度大小是多少 μT？（μ₀/2π=2×10⁻⁷ T·m/A）", "expected_answer": ["50 μT"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 50, "tol": 1}, "solution_path": "B=(μ₀/2π)·I/r=2×10⁻⁷·10/0.04=5×10⁻⁵ T=50 μT。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 B=μ₀I/(2πr)", "evidence": ["b=μ₀i/(2πr)", "b=μ0i/(2πr)", "b=μ₀i", "安培环路"]}, {"point": "代入 2×10⁻⁷·10/0.04", "evidence": ["代入", "2e-7", "/0.04"]}, {"point": "B=50 μT", "evidence": ["50μt", "50μt", "50"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "314", "desc": "忘了除 2π（用 μ₀ 而非 μ₀/2π）"}, {"wrong": "值是5", "desc": "数量级错（忘换 μT 或 10⁻⁷ 的幂）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(2e-7*10/Rational(4,100)*10**6)"}}
{"id": "em-025", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：电场能量密度", "question": "真空中匀强电场场强 E=3×10⁶ V/m（ε₀=8.85×10⁻¹² F/m）。求电场能量密度（J/m³，保留三位有效数字）。", "expected_answer": ["≈ 39.8 J/m³"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 39.8, "tol": 0.5}, "solution_path": "u=½ε₀E²=0.5·8.85×10⁻¹²·(3×10⁶)²=0.5·8.85×10⁻¹²·9×10¹²≈39.8 J/m³。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 u=½ε₀E²", "evidence": ["u=½ε₀e²", "u=½ε0E^2", "½ε₀e²", "能量密度"]}, {"point": "E²=9×10¹²", "evidence": ["9e12", "代入", "平方"]}, {"point": "u≈39.8 J/m³", "evidence": ["39.8", "40", "≈40"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "79.7", "desc": "忘乘 ½"}, {"wrong": "0.04", "desc": "幂次换算错（10¹² 丢了两个量级）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Rational(1,2)*8.85e-12*9e12)"}}
{"id": "em-026", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：断开电源后插介质", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「平行板电容器充电后断开电源，再插入介电常数为 εr 的介质填满间隙，极板间电压保持不变，因为电源刚充过电。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。断开电源后极板电荷 Q 不变；插入介质使 C 增大为 εr·C₀，由 U=Q/C，电压减小为原来的 1/εr。「电源充过电」不代表电压被锁定——锁定电压的是接通电源的情形。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出断电后 Q 不变", "evidence": ["电荷不变", "q不变", "q不变", "断开"]}, {"point": "C 增大 → U=Q/C 减小", "evidence": ["u=q/c", "c增大", "电压减小", "1/εr"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "电压不变", "desc": "把「接电源电压不变」的结论搬到断电情形"}]}
{"id": "em-027", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：静电场的保守性", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「让电荷沿静电场中的闭合回路走一圈再回到出发点，电场力做的功可以不为零，这样就能做成永动机。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。静电场是保守场：场强沿任何闭合回路的环流恒为零（∮E·dl=0），电场力做功与路径无关、只与起止点电势差有关。走一圈回到原点做功必为零——这正是「电压（电势差）」概念能成立的基础。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出静电场保守、环流恒为零", "evidence": ["保守场", "环流", "为零", "∮"]}, {"point": "做功只与起止电势差有关", "evidence": ["路径无关", "电势差", "只与", "无关"]}, {"point": "回原点电势差为零故做功为零", "evidence": ["回到原点", "一圈", "闭合", "零"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "可以不为零", "desc": "把非保守场（如感生电场）的性质套到静电场"}]}
{"id": "em-028", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "concept", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "探针：磁感线闭合", "question": "有同学说：「磁感线和电场线一样，从 N 极出发、到 S 极终止，是有起点和终点的曲线。」这个说法对吗？请说明磁感线的完整走向。", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法不完整且误导：磁感线在磁体外部从 N 到 S，但在磁体内部从 S 回到 N，整体是无头无尾的闭合曲线。这与电场线（正电荷发出、负电荷终止）根本不同，根源是没有磁单极子。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出磁感线是闭合曲线", "evidence": ["闭合", "闭合曲线", "无头无尾"]}, {"point": "磁体内部从 S 回到 N", "evidence": ["内部", "s回到n", "从s到n", "s到n"]}, {"point": "与不存在磁单极有关", "evidence": ["磁单极", "单极子", "没有磁单极"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "有起点和终点", "desc": "只看了磁体外部，忽略了内部回路"}]}
{"id": "em-029", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：匀强场电压 U=Ed", "question": "匀强电场场强 E=500 V/m。求沿场强方向相距 0.2 m 的两点间的电压。", "expected_answer": ["100 V"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 100, "tol": 0.5}, "solution_path": "匀强场：U=Ed=500·0.2=100 V。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 U=Ed（匀强场）", "evidence": ["u=ed", "匀强场"]}, {"point": "500·0.2", "evidence": ["代入", "场强乘距离"]}, {"point": "U=100 V", "evidence": ["100v", "=100", "100"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "2500", "desc": "把 E/d 当电压（除了距离）"}, {"wrong": "电压50", "desc": "距离错用 0.1（幂次看错）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(500*Rational(1,5))"}}
{"id": "em-030", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：并联分流", "question": "R₁=6 Ω 与 R₂=3 Ω 并联，干路电流 3 A。求通过 R₁ 与 R₂ 的电流。", "expected_answer": ["I₁=1 A；I₂=2 A"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [1, 2], "tol": 0.02}, "solution_path": "并联电压相同，分流与电阻成反比：I₁=3·(3/9)=1 A；I₂=3·(6/9)=2 A。", "key_steps": [{"point": "并联分流与电阻成反比", "evidence": ["反比", "分流"]}, {"point": "I₁=3·(3/9)=1 A", "evidence": ["1a", "i₁=1", "小电阻分大流的反记"]}, {"point": "I₂=2 A", "evidence": ["2a", "i₂=2"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "各1.5安", "desc": "把电流平分（不管电阻）"}, {"wrong": "两支路对调", "desc": "反比关系用反（大的电流给了大电阻）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[float(3*Rational(3,9)), float(3*Rational(6,9))]"}}
{"id": "em-031", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：动生电动势 ε=BLv", "question": "长 0.5 m 的直导体棒以 4 m/s 垂直切割 B=0.8 T 的匀强磁场磁感线。求棒中感应电动势大小。", "expected_answer": ["1.6 V"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 1.6, "tol": 0.02}, "solution_path": "ε=BLv=0.8·0.5·4=1.6 V。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 ε=BLv", "evidence": ["ε=blv", "e=blv", "动生电动势"]}, {"point": "0.8·0.5·4", "evidence": ["代入", "三个量相乘"]}, {"point": "ε=1.6 V", "evidence": ["1.6v", "=1.6", "1.6"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "0.4", "desc": "漏乘速度（只算 B·L）"}, {"wrong": "6.4", "desc": "把速度平方或多乘一因子"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Rational(4,5)*Rational(1,2)*4)"}}
{"id": "em-032", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：自感系数", "question": "线圈中电流在 0.1 s 内从 2 A 均匀减小到零，测得自感电动势为 4 V。求线圈的自感系数 L（H）。", "expected_answer": ["0.2 H"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 0.2, "tol": 0.005}, "solution_path": "ε=L·|dI/dt|=L·(2/0.1)=20L=4，L=4/20=0.2 H。", "key_steps": [{"point": "自感电动势 ε=L·dI/dt", "evidence": ["自感", "e=ldi/dt", "di/dt"]}, {"point": "dI/dt=20 A/s", "evidence": ["20a/s", "20", "2/0.1", "变化率"]}, {"point": "L=4/20=0.2 H", "evidence": ["0.2h", "=0.2", "0.2"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "40", "desc": "除以 0.1 而不是除以变化率 20"}, {"wrong": "0.02", "desc": "数量级换算错"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(4/20)"}}
{"id": "em-033", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：速度选择器（正交场）", "question": "正交的匀强电场与磁场中（E 垂直 B），一束带电粒子沿直线穿过（电场力与磁场力平衡）。已知 E=600 V/m、B=0.3 T。求直线穿过粒子的速度。", "expected_answer": ["2000 m/s"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 2000, "tol": 5}, "solution_path": "平衡：qE=qvB → v=E/B=600/0.3=2000 m/s（与电量、符号无关）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "电场力与洛伦兹力平衡 qE=qvB", "evidence": ["qe=qvb", "平衡", "电场力"]}, {"point": "v=E/B", "evidence": ["v=e/b", "e/b"]}, {"point": "v=2000 m/s", "evidence": ["2000", "2e3", "两千米每秒"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "180", "desc": "把 E 与 B 相乘"}, {"wrong": "速度2", "desc": "单位/幂次错（0.6/0.3 之类）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(600/Rational(3,10))"}}
{"id": "em-034", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：绝缘体与击穿", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「绝缘体绝对不导电，任何条件下都没有电流。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。绝缘体只是载流子极少、常规条件下几乎不导电；强电场下会被击穿（空气击穿放电、闪电），高温或掺杂质也会显著导电。绝缘是相对的、有条件的。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出绝缘是相对/有条件的", "evidence": ["相对", "有条件", "不是绝对"]}, {"point": "举击穿/放电例子", "evidence": ["击穿", "放电", "闪电", "强电场"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "绝对不导电", "desc": "把「难导电」绝对化"}]}
{"id": "em-035", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：串联功率分配", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「两电阻串联接入电路，功率与电阻成反比，因为 P=U²/R。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。串联时电流相同，应使用 P=I²R：功率与电阻成正比，大电阻更烫。P=U²/R 只在各元件电压相同（并联）时用于比较，把总电压代入该式与单个电阻比较是误用。", "key_steps": [{"point": "串联用 P=I²R（电流相同）", "evidence": ["p=i²r", "p=i^2r", "电流相同", "串联"]}, {"point": "功率与电阻成正比", "evidence": ["正比", "成正比"]}, {"point": "P=U²/R 适用于并联同压", "evidence": ["u²/r", "u^2/r", "并联", "电压相同"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "成反比", "desc": "不看串并联结构乱套 P=U²/R"}]}
{"id": "em-036", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：楞次定律方向", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「楞次定律告诉我们：感应电流的磁场方向总是与原磁场方向相反。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。楞次定律说的是感应电流的磁场「阻碍磁通量的变化」：磁通增大时与原磁场反向（阻碍增大），磁通减小时与原磁场同向（填补、阻碍减小）。不是一律相反。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出关键是阻碍磁通变化", "evidence": ["阻碍", "磁通变化", "变化"]}, {"point": "分两种情形：增大反向、减小同向", "evidence": ["增大时反向", "增大反向", "减小时同向", "减小同向", "同向"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "总是相反", "desc": "把「阻碍变化」简化成「方向相反」"}]}
{"id": "em-037", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：点电荷模型的适用边界", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「E=kq/r² 在 r→0 时趋于无穷，这证明经典电磁学完全错误、应当抛弃。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。发散只说明「点电荷」这个理想模型在极小尺度失效：真实电荷有分布（电子也不是经典意义上的点球），公式有自己的适用条件。超出适用条件推结论，再据此否定整个理论是过度引申；经典电磁学在宏观尺度极其成功。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出点电荷是理想模型、有适用条件", "evidence": ["理想模型", "适用条件", "模型"]}, {"point": "小尺度应换更精细的描述", "evidence": ["分布", "小尺度", "更精细", "量子"]}, {"point": "不能由边界外推就否定整个理论", "evidence": ["并非全错", "过度引申", "宏观", "成功"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "完全错误", "desc": "把模型边界当成理论整体失效"}]}
{"id": "em-038", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：电磁波是横波", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「电磁波是纵波，电场和磁场都沿传播方向振动。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。电磁波是横波：E⊥B⊥传播方向，三者两两垂直（右手螺旋）。偏振现象是横波的标志（纵波无偏振），光的偏振直接证明其横波性。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出 E⊥B⊥k（横波）", "evidence": ["横波", "垂直", "e⊥b", "e⊥b⊥k"]}, {"point": "以偏振现象为证据", "evidence": ["偏振", "偏振片"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "是纵波", "desc": "与声波类比弄错振动方向"}]}
{"id": "em-039", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "concept", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "探针：摩擦起电与电荷守恒", "question": "有同学说：「摩擦起电创造了电荷：摩擦后物体带电，说明电荷无中生有。」这个说法对吗？请说明。", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。摩擦起电是电荷的转移：电子从一个物体转移到另一个物体，一方失电子带正电、另一方得电子带负电，两种电荷总量始终守恒（电荷守恒定律）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出是电荷转移不是创造", "evidence": ["转移", "不是创造", "转移电子"]}, {"point": "正负电荷同时出现且总量守恒", "evidence": ["守恒", "电荷守恒", "等量异号", "等量"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "创造了电荷", "desc": "把转移误当无中生有"}]}
{"id": "em-040", "domain": "electromagnetism", "kind": "concept", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "探针：电磁波与介质", "question": "有同学说：「和声波一样，电磁波传播也需要介质；真空中没有介质，所以电磁波传不出去。」这个说法对吗？请说明电磁波靠什么传播。", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。电磁波不需要介质：变化的电场激发磁场、变化的磁场又激发电场，两者相互激发、自持向前传播，在真空中畅通无阻（阳光穿过真空到达地球）。19 世纪的「以太」假设已被迈克尔逊-莫雷实验否定。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出电磁波无需介质", "evidence": ["无需介质", "真空传播", "真空"]}, {"point": "机制是变化的 E 与 B 相互激发", "evidence": ["相互激发", "变化的电场", "变化的磁场", "自持"]}, {"point": "以太假设已被否定", "evidence": ["以太", "迈克尔逊", "否定"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "需要介质", "desc": "把机械波的传播条件搬到电磁波"}]}
